    |         ____                         |
A --------*---\   \ D               ___    |
    |     |    >   >---------------|   \   |
    |  +--|---/___/                |    )----- S
    |  |  |              |\  E  +--|___/   |
    |  |  |           +--| >o---+          |
    |  |  |    ___    |  |/                |
    |  |  +---|   \   |                    |
